{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2024-02/1061202/block/singleImage/3253561/df/TW_1.JPG?updatedAt=1793343559\"/><figcaption>荃灣荃德花園有六旬婦墮樓亡(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>荃灣有六旬婦墮樓亡。今日(30日)早上11時02分，荃景圍208號荃德花園保安員報案，指懷疑一名女子從高處墮下。救援人員接報到場，發現事主倒臥在上址一天井位罝，經檢驗後證實已當場死亡。警員經初步調查，證實64歲姓盧女子為上址住戶，相信她從上址一單位墮下，現場沒有檢獲遺書，案件列作「有人從高處墮下」處理，死因有待驗屍後確定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:43:48.379102+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":182,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:59:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:08.090815+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:39:08.090815+00:00","content_hash":"c62662ad9e71de3cd5aa6f432151a3b79889118d85f08b5e69b9696b223911e9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}